{"id":"d_main_28_05_s","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch28","label":"Chapter 28 · The Unknown"},"label":"Super Vision: A","stage":"28-27 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_28_04_e","next":"d_main_28_05_e","speakers":{"anis":"Anis","liveryn":"Liveryn","elegg":"Elegg","neon":"Neon","hammering":"Hammering","rapi":"Rapi","shifty":"Shifty"},"icons":{"anis":"si_c012_00_s","liveryn":"si_c480_00_s","elegg":"si_c500_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","hammering":"si_c490_00_s","rapi":"si_c010_00_s","shifty":"si_c907_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_1","text":"So, what's our goal?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CrystalCity","bgArt":"crystalcity","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_destroyingcalamity_b","movie":null,"shown":["neon","anis","rapi","liveryn","elegg","hammering"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_2","text":"Clear a path to that crystal cluster?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_3","text":"Yes. Now, the path might undergo some changes the next time we come back, but they will most likely only be slight variations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_4","text":"The growth rate of these crystals is slow, and there doesn't seem to be significant energy sources remaining in this city.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_5","text":"We should return after conducting a brief investigation of the crystal cluster.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_6","text":"Huh? Why are we heading back?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_7","text":"It would be nice to utilize the crystal cluster straight away, but we don't have the appropriate equipment for such an endeavor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_8","text":"We need to conduct more thorough research first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_9","text":"If this crystal cluster is everything Elegg claims it to be, it's a significant discovery.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_10","text":"If everything goes well, we might conduct periodic expeditions for crystals in the future,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_11","text":"and we may well be part of those search teams.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_12","text":"We'll no longer have to worry about living day to day.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_13","text":"And the Commander will get boatloads of respect for leading a successful operation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_14","text":"Oh boy, just the thought of all that fame... all that power... gives me butterflies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_15","text":"Have you found a suitable path, Liveryn?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_16","text":"Yes. The closer we get to the crystal cluster, the stronger the light from the crystals on the ground will be.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_17","text":"It's a very subtle difference, but it's definitely there.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_18","text":"Subtle enough to not be detectable with the naked eye.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_19","text":"I can activate my light detection vision.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_20","text":"Don't. If you keep that function on for too long, it's like riding an express train straight to a Mind Switch.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_21","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_21","text":"Shifty, anything you can do for us?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_22","text":"Yes. I'll upload a light detection feature to your operation device.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_23","text":"Just a moment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_24","text":"Ms. Shifty, you probably won't be able to communicate with us while we're using the light detection function,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_25","text":"since it'll take up the entire operation device.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_26","text":"Well, there's not much we can do about that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_27","text":"Hold on, Ms. Neon can do it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_28","text":"Huh? Me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_29","text":"Yep.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_30","text":"Me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_31","text":"Yep.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_32","text":"It's like watching two parrots go back and forth...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_33","text":"All I have is a firepower detection sensor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_34","text":"Could you lightly tap the upper left frame of your glasses three times?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_35","text":"??","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_36","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_36","text":"*Tap tap tap*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_37","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_37","text":"*Pop*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"White","bgArt":"white","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_38","text":"Agh! My eyes!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_39","text":"That, my friend, is a light amplification function. If anything is emitting even the slightest bit of luminescence, you'll be able to see it clearly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CrystalCity","bgArt":"crystalcity","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_40","text":"Do you notice a difference in the brightness of the crystals?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_41","text":"Oh, yeah! The crystals get brighter the further along you go.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_42","text":"Great, then lead the way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_43","text":"Ms. Neon can guide us, Ms. Liveryn can plot the route, and Ms. Hammering can clear the path.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_44","text":"Sounds good.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"hammering","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_45","text":"No problem.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_46","text":"All right, then it's official. From here on out, I am no longer Neon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_47","text":"I'm Neon with super vision! I'm Neon with... Vision Eye!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_48","text":"... Nope, it's still a terrible name. What kind of magic glasses are those, anyway?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_49","text":"I'm not so sure myself. All I know for sure is that they're high-performance glasses with a multitude of functions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_50","text":"I'll have to give them a look when we're back in the Ark to find out more.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_51","text":"None of this technology is something you'd find at any of the Big Three,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"elegg","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_52","text":"and it's too high-level to be a personal customization job.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_53","text":"... Something's fishy here.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_54","text":"I'll look into it on my end. I have my own theory.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_55","text":"Let's hear it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_56","text":"No, I don't want to say anything until I'm sure. I'll contact you after I look into it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_57","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_28_05_s_58","text":"Dang, now you actually seem like a real spy for once.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_28_05_s_59","type"